## Customize VM flags. Reference: http://erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -name / -setcookie come from rel/env.sh.eex (Docker-aware).

## Concurrent ports/sockets — default 16384 is too low for WS-heavy workloads.
+Q 65536

## Match scheduler count to container CPU limit (host has 2 cores).
## Without this, BEAM sees host CPUs and oversubscribes inside cgroup.
+S 2:2

## Disable scheduler busy-wait — saves CPU on small machines.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
